(Japanese: '''ポケットモンスター・秋のスペシャル！''' ''{{tt|Pocket Monsters|Pokémon}}, Fall Special!'') is a 90-minute special, which included a one-hour [[clip show]], that aired immediately after the original broadcast of the {{aniseries|OS}} episode ''[[EP028|Pokémon Fashion Flash]]''.

This clipshow was released on a rental VHS series, Pocket Monsters TV Special: {{tt|Masara Town|Pallet Town}} Arc Recap, as ''[[The Journey to be a Pokémon Master Begins!!]]''.

